              "units": 1.0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "audit_criteria",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Drawer audit criteria",
          "items": [
            "Drawer, operator, register, and period are linked",
            "Starting float agrees with prior custody record",
            "Denomination subtotals support the cash total",
            "Non-cash tenders are separately reconciled",
            "Paid-in, paid-out, refund, and void references exist",
            "Expected POS total uses the correct business period",
            "Recount and variance rules are documented",
            "Deposit or float custody has both parties",
            "Sensitive details remain in restricted systems",
            "Open variance work has owner and due point"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "audit_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Audit conclusion boundary",
          "guidance": "This record supports operational reconciliation, not accounting, legal, or fraud conclusions. Do not record safe combinations, reusable credentials, full card or bank data, or unsupported accusations. During a threat, prioritize the approved emergency response and do not confront or pursue. Follow applicable cash, privacy, security, and retention policy and route judgment to the authorized reviewer."
        }
      ]
    },
